WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.960
The Whisperer War may be over, but the premiere&nbsp;
of The Walking Dead's six bonus season 10 episodes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.880
is proof that in the apocalypse, there&nbsp;
are always new threats waiting to emerge.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:14.720
Released on AMC+ on Sunday, February 21,&nbsp;
2021 — a full week before its cable debut&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.040
on February 28 — the new episode, entitled&nbsp;
"Home Sweet Home," picks up in the aftermath&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.840
of the bloody season 10B finale and wastes&nbsp;
no time answering some lingering questions.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.880
Longtime Walking Dead fans will&nbsp;
likely be thrilled to see that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.280
not only is this new installment Maggie-centric,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:33.600
but it also features Lauren Cohan once again&nbsp;
listed as a main cast member on the series.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.920
"Home Sweet Home" packs a lot of action&nbsp;
and exposition into its 41-minute runtime.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.920
Viewers get the lowdown on what Maggie has been&nbsp;
up to since she disappeared from the show back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:46.480
in season 9, as well as deeper insight into&nbsp;
the intimidating masked survivor we saw her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:50.160
with when she reappeared in the season&nbsp;
10B finale. In returning to the show,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:54.320
Maggie also brought with her a potential new&nbsp;
threat to the survivors in Alexandria. That's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:58.640
not even to mention the complications her arrival&nbsp;
could pose for Negan's place in the community.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.080
Here's what went down in The Walking&nbsp;
Dead season 10's first bonus episode,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:06.000
"Home Sweet Home," and what the events&nbsp;
and reveals could signify for the future.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.040
After being absent since the time&nbsp;
jump in the middle of season 9,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:13.040
Maggie returned with new allies in tow to&nbsp;
help silence the threat of the Whisperers.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.960
Since leaving Alexandria, Maggie has been&nbsp;
traveling from community to community with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:21.040
her son Hershel. We only meet two members of&nbsp;
the group she's currently with at the beginning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.560
of the episode, as the rest are hunkered&nbsp;
down in a basecamp with young Hershel.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:28.240
Maggie and her new allies team up with Daryl&nbsp;
and Kelly to find their way back to the rest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:31.440
of the group. Through this mission, it&nbsp;
becomes clear that Maggie's strength,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:35.280
compassion, and determination have made&nbsp;
her a natural leader for this new group.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:39.760
She has a particularly close relationship with&nbsp;
Elijah, the formerly unnamed masked survivor we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:44.640
met in the season 10B finale. Elijah's silent&nbsp;
and intimidating appearance made some fellow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:49.040
survivors uneasy. However, in this episode, we&nbsp;
get some surprising insight into his character.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:53.120
While the group is camping out overnight on their&nbsp;
way to meet up with Maggie's people, Kelly wanders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:56.960
off while she's supposed to be on guard duty.&nbsp;
She's discovered the next morning inspecting some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:01.760
clothing on a crashed truck nearby, and Maggie&nbsp;
confronts her about her abandonment of the group.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.840
Daryl explains that in the&nbsp;
midst of everything else,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:08.560
Kelly is still trying to find her sister Connie,&nbsp;
who has been missing since earlier in season 10.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:13.360
Maggie accepts this explanation and tells Kelly&nbsp;
that Elijah also recently lost his own sister.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.160
When the group gets entangled in&nbsp;
a dangerous situation later on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:19.760
in the episode, Kelly notices that&nbsp;
Elijah seems to be frozen in fear.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:24.080
She asks him to lift up his mask. He does,&nbsp;
and reveals that he's a young man who does&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:27.520
indeed look incredibly anxious about&nbsp;
the danger they've found themselves in.

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.960
For Elijah, the scary mask he wears&nbsp;
is quite literally a cover to shield&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:34.480
himself from the outside world. With&nbsp;
it on, people are intimidated by him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:37.920
but only because they can't see that&nbsp;
underneath, he's the one who's terrified.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.920
Kelly gives him a quick pep talk, and later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:42.880
Elijah shares some food with her&nbsp;
to cement their budding friendship.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:47.040
It remains to be seen whether Elijah will become&nbsp;
stronger and more confident moving forward,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.000
which would be beneficial to him and&nbsp;
his fellow survivors the inevitable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.520
next time they're in trouble, or if the&nbsp;
dangers of the world around him will become&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:57.840
too much and cause him to slip further into&nbsp;
fear and potentially lead to a tragic end.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:00.640
The Walking Dead has seen enough&nbsp;
death and destruction over the years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:04.320
so hopefully Elijah's narrative arc&nbsp;
will be a positive, uplifting one — or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:08.080
at least as positive and uplifting&nbsp;
as things can get in a zombie show.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.760
Maggie's journey to reunite with the rest&nbsp;
of her group takes a tragic turn when she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:15.680
arrives at the shelter they've been using and&nbsp;
finds it ransacked and burned to the ground.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:20.000
There are several dead bodies among the wreckage,&nbsp;
but Hershel is missing. Although the perpetrators&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:24.400
of this attack are nowhere to be seen, Maggie&nbsp;
and her allies seem to know exactly who did it:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.960
the Reapers, whom Cole believes&nbsp;
have been following their group.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:29.440
"It's them. They found us."

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:33.200
The crew splits up to find any survivors&nbsp;
of the attack, and eventually, Maggie and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:36.400
Daryl come across three other members&nbsp;
of her group who got away. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.160
someone with a sniper rifle hiding in&nbsp;
the woods quickly picks the trio off.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.480
The sniper eventually emerges and reveals himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:45.600
to be completely decked out in&nbsp;
camouflage and tactical gear.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:49.520
After a scuffle, Maggie and Daryl get the upper&nbsp;
hand against the sniper. Maggie attempts to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:53.440
get answers out of the man, whose group has&nbsp;
been attacking them for seemingly no reason.

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:57.440
"Who are you? Who are you?&nbsp;
What do you call yourselves?"

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.440
Instead of giving her answers, the man pulls the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:02.480
pin out of a grenade strapped to&nbsp;
his chest and blows himself up.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.440
It's unclear what exactly&nbsp;
the Reapers' true purpose is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:08.640
especially since they don't have any&nbsp;
connections to the Walking Dead comics.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:12.400
Considering that the sniper was equipped&nbsp;
with several weapons, was wearing attire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:16.800
designed for stealthiness, and was outfitted&nbsp;
in tactical gear, it seems plausible that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:20.960
Reapers' members may have military experience&nbsp;
from their lives pre-zombie apocalypse.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:24.240
They may even be off-shoots of or&nbsp;
somehow related to the Commonwealth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:28.000
or possibly the Civil Republic Military.&nbsp;
Whatever their background, it's clear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.840
that the Reapers aren't some slapped-together&nbsp;
faction of survivors who are winging things.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.960
They're organized, ruthless, and&nbsp;
will evidently stop at nothing to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.440
meet their goals -- whatever those goals may be.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.280
Regardless of what their mission ends up being,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:43.440
this certainly isn't the last we'll see of&nbsp;
this new enemy in The Walking Dead season 10.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:46.560
After the run-in with the Reapers'&nbsp;
sniper, Maggie goes off to find her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:50.320
son. Thankfully for Maggie, she's raised&nbsp;
young Hershel in her resourceful image,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:53.040
and she eventually finds him&nbsp;
safe and hiding in a tree.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:56.080
With her son by her side but her&nbsp;
group in shambles, Maggie decides&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.080 --> 00:05:00.400
to accompany Daryl and Kelly back to Alexandria.&nbsp;
There's the promise of safety in numbers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.960
which Maggie needs right now, but returning&nbsp;
to Alexandria isn't an easy decision for her.

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:08.560
At the beginning of "Home Sweet Home,"&nbsp;
Maggie also comes face-to-face with Negan.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.280
Viewers have seen his character&nbsp;
go through many twists and turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.360
over the course of the series, but for Maggie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:17.120
he'll always be the man who brutally killed&nbsp;
her husband Glenn all those years ago.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.280
It's clear that Maggie isn't interested in living&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:22.080
anywhere near Negan -- and you&nbsp;
can't really blame her for that.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:28.000
"The truth is, I left home because I couldn't have&nbsp;
Negan taking up any more space in my head. Then I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.320
realized I didn't want to&nbsp;
bring Hershel back to that."

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:33.920
However, throughout the episode Maggie&nbsp;
realizes that she has no choice but to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:36.320
go back to Alexandria, where Negan lives.

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:38.960
She tells Carol that she doesn't&nbsp;
hold any hard feelings against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:42.800
her for bringing Negan into the Alexandria&nbsp;
mix to help with the Whisperer situation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.000
and assures Daryl that she'll deal with&nbsp;
her feelings for the good of her group.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.320
As she walks back into town&nbsp;
for the first time in years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.720
Maggie wears a look of hardened determination.&nbsp;
The camera lingers on Negan as he watches her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:57.200
walk by, possibly indicating that tensions&nbsp;
between him and Maggie are far from over.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.960
Both characters have undergone huge changes&nbsp;
over the years, and things really could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:05.280
go either way for Maggie and Negan as the&nbsp;
remaining episodes of season 10 play out.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:08.960
In a perfect world, Negan never would have&nbsp;
done what he did and Maggie could return to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:13.760
Alexandria without any qualms — but it seems&nbsp;
the best anyone can do here is hope that Negan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:18.080
and Maggie's volatile past doesn't make their&nbsp;
current situation any worse than it needs to be.

